# Project Overview

Personal portfolio site (**ARCHITECT.DEV**) for Pham Huy Hoang — monochrome, Swiss/architectural minimal UI.

## Stack

- **Nuxt 4** (`future.compatibilityVersion: 4`) with `app/` directory
- **Vue 3** + **TypeScript** + **vue-router**
- **Tailwind CSS 4** + **@nuxt/ui** 4 (app shell / toast; custom UI preferred)
- **@nuxt/content** 3 — blog in `content/posts/`
- **@nuxt/image**, **@nuxt/eslint**, **@nuxtjs/google-fonts**, **@nuxtjs/sitemap**
- **Zod** (`shared/contact.ts`) + **Resend** for contact API
- Package manager: **pnpm** only (`pnpm dev|build|lint|typecheck|preview`)

## Directory map

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `app/pages/` | Routes: `/` (hash sections), `/posts`, `/posts/[...slug]`; `/work` & `/contact` redirect to hashes |
| `app/components/{home,layout,ui,posts}/` | Feature-grouped SFCs |
| `app/layouts/` | `default` only |
| `app/data/` | Static site/project/skill content + types |
| `app/utils/` | Shared helpers (`posts`, `nav`) |
| `app/composables/` | Vue composables (`useSiteSeo`) |
| `shared/` | Isomorphic schemas (contact) |
| `app/assets/css/main.css` | Design tokens & utilities |
| `content/posts/` | Markdown posts |
| `server/api/` | Nitro handlers |
| `docs/2026-07-27/` | Refactor/upgrade phase tasks |
| `.stitch/DESIGN.md` | Visual system source (design archive; not required at runtime) |

## Agent defaults

- Match existing patterns; prefer editing data/components over inventing new abstractions.
- Do not add cards/shadows/rounded UI that fights the sharp monochrome system.
- Secrets stay in `runtimeConfig` / env (`resendApiKey`, etc.) — never hardcode API keys.
